IMMUNOMET_ONEIL_GLYCOLYSIS	Glycolysis: glucose, pyruvate, lactate. Core pathway of activated effector immune cells (Warburg-like). Framework: O'Neill, Kishton, Rathmell 2016 Nat Rev Immunol.	Lac	Pyruvic acid	Glucose
IMMUNOMET_ONEIL_TCA	Tricarboxylic acid cycle intermediates including itaconate (ACOD1 product) and 2-hydroxyglutarate. "Broken" TCA with citrate/succinate accumulation is a hallmark of M1 macrophages. Framework: O'Neill et al. 2016.	2-OH-Glutaric acid	a-Ketoglutaric acid	Fumaric acid	Itaconic acid	Malic acid	Oxaloacetic acid	Suc	AconAcid	Citric acid	Isocitric acid
